{"v":4,"catch":"頓悟謎題與邏輯謎題\n一個關於點滴回憶的故事","desc":"《Treehouse Riddle》是一款通過解開頓悟謎題與邏輯謎題來推進故事進程的\n“頓悟謎題×邏輯謎題 冒險遊戲”。\n\n主角被困在了樹屋的一間房內。\n在用懷舊像素風格繪製的房間內探索，\n通過解開謎題來尋找逃離樹屋的手段。\n\n正如同樹屋一般，謎題由溫馨的木製紋理繪製。\n一起來不緊不慢地體驗總數超過60個的智力挑戰吧。\n\n所有謎題都擁有“提示”和“跳過”功能。\n即便是不擅長解謎的玩家，也不會有卡關的後顧之憂。","publisher":"Fruitbat Factory","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/953f9b33b317e3020d655d58d75b936be258fbab16beaa43938a2df3a7cac288.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cec189f20d41f94cfb74d937f9ae13b6c3cee0b0ea3bc3ba9ed99d6272a1a1cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62571f63aaf42b2660c12865f15c54ed30b15457bcb37240ef3fea002c377cff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e777dc7d9e57026355c91da9c214a752b744e2cc26422d440011573780037a49.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac78d7a5bf432886c17768ac7fe5f34968d5ab50c5863dd657cadf21b574039b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cc9b114c54c9190050c176e8287bea531997dbfeeea1cc84381d54e700f8133.jpg"],"titleId":"010000900f710000","dlc":[],"vids":["p2N23Doj9cY"]}